-## Bosses and endless loops
+## Bosses and the 50-stage finish
 
-The default trial route is now a 50-stage loop. The existing simple enemy cycle remains selectable in setup. The normal enemy cycle is indexed by local stage 1–50, with Speed Core replacing stages 25 and 40, and Mother Core replacing stage 50. Bosses return at 75/90/100, etc. A surviving victory at stage 50 produces one reward and continues to stage 51.
